{
  "info": {
    "name": "Lumi S4 Interaction",
    "_postman_id": "s4-interaction-collection-001",
    "description": "S4 交互运行时 API 测试集合（黑盒测试，仅设备侧视角）\n\n## 鉴权\n- 业务请求使用 device-platform 签发的 `device_access_token`（Bearer）\n- 健康检查 / bootstrap 等无鉴权端点除外\n\n## 使用方式\n- 单接口测试：直接 Send，prerequest 自动生成 trace_id/request_id\n- 场景序列：选中文件夹 → Run Folder，环境变量自动串联\n\n## 真源文档\n- https://github.com/chadwangcn/lumi-s4-interaction/blob/main/docs/openapi.yaml",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "trace_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "request_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "idempotency_key",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 · 健康检查",
      "description": "S4 健康检查与元数据端点（免鉴权）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "H1 GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ]
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('success=true', () => pm.expect(j.success).to.be.true);",
                  "pm.test('service=s4-interaction', () => pm.expect(j.data.service).to.eql('s4-interaction'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "H2 GET /healthz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{origin_url}}/healthz",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
